  unitName: Extremist Robespierre (EU)
  unitId: 760254
  unitNumber: 7216
  description: "A politician frightened by the Shapeshifters. Although he\u2019s
    against them, he doesn\u2019t dare show his opposition out of fear of retaliation.
    One day, he has a vision of a world where humans are massacred under the orders
    of a Shapeshifter tyrant. He thus decides to rise up against them by joining
    up with the hunters. He is the extremist within the group and wants to go all
    the way in order to change things. He will push his companions to more and more
    violence. His goal is clear: he wants all Shapeshifters dead."
  summonDesc: We must defend ourselves from these scoundrels!
  fusionDesc: "I\u2019m willing to do anything for the sake of humanity..."
